# 23. Important Networking Terms

### MAC Address

A hardware/network-interface address used for local network communication.

### IP Address

A logical address used to identify and communicate with devices across IP networks.

### Port

A logical endpoint used to identify a network service or application.

Example:

```text
HTTPS → 443
SSH   → 22
DNS   → 53
```

### Packet

Network-layer data unit.

### Frame

Data-link-layer data unit.

### Segment

Transport-layer data unit for TCP.

### Bits

Physical-layer representation of transmitted data.

